;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:10.0pt'>S.B.<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span style='position:relative;z-index:251658240;left:-52px;\r\ntop:495px;width:994px;height:497px'><img width=795 height=2\r\nsrc=\"data:image\/gif;base64,R0lGODlh4gMCAHcAMSH+GlNvZnR3YXJlOiBNaWNyb3NvZnQgT2ZmaWNlACH5BAEAAAAALAAAAADiAwIAgAAAAAAAAAJGBHKJq83vIpyy0msz3rrz74XgKJbkaaboqrbs68bwLNf0bef4rvf87wsChwaiUYg8KpPMpbMJfUqj1Km1ir1qs9ytNwEoAAA7\"><\/span><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:14.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<br clear=ALL>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><u><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:14.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>DEPARTMENT\r\nOF RADIOLOGY &amp; IMAGING<\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>ULTRASONOGRAPHY OF UPPER ABDOMEN\r\n[PORTABLE\/SCREENING]<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>=======================================================<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>LIVER:<\/span><\/b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'> Span:- __________ mm ; AP\r\ndiameter:- __________ mm (approx). <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>The\r\nparenchymal echopattern is normal. There is no sizeable focal parenchymal\r\nabnormality. Intrahepatic vascular and biliary radicles are not dilated. Left\r\nlobe and caudate lobe appears normal in size.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>GALL\r\nBLADDER<\/span><\/b><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>: Shows\r\nphysiological distension. The walls are regular and normal in thickness. Lumen\r\nis clear. No sizeable calculus is seen in the lumen.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>PORTA:\r\n<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>CBD<\/span><\/b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>:- Normal in calibre (_________mm)\r\nand shows clear lumen. No obvious calculus or SOL noted within. No filling\r\ndefect seen.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>Portal\r\nVein:-<\/span><\/b><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'> Measures\r\napprox. __________mm (normal).<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>PANCREAS:<\/span><\/b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'> The outline is regular.\r\nEchopattern is normal. No SOL is seen. Pancreatic duct is not dilated. No\r\nabnormality is seen in peripancreatic region.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>SPLEEN:<\/span><\/b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'> Normal in size, outline and\r\nechotexture. No focal abnormality is seen in the parenchyma. The splenic vein\r\nand its tributaries appear normal. <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>Splenic\r\nSpan___________ mm (approx).<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>KIDNEYS:\r\n<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>Right\r\nKidney:-<\/span><\/b><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>\r\n________ x ________ mm (approx). <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>Left\r\nKidney:-<\/span><\/b><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>\r\n_________ x _________ mm (approx). <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>Both\r\nkidneys are normal in size, shape, outline and position. The cortical\r\nechotexture is normal with preserved cortico-medullary echodifferentiation.\r\nThere is no evidence of cystic lesion, renal calculi or hydronephrotic changes.\r\nPerirenal spaces are clear.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>URETERS:<\/span><\/b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'> Not dilated hence not\r\nvisualized.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>MISCELLANEOUS:<\/span><\/b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'> No free fluid is seen in\r\nperitoneal cavity \/ either pleural space. No retroperitoneal abnormality is\r\nseen. Aorta and IVC appears normal. No enlarged para-aortic lymphnodes seen.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>IMPRESSION:\r\n<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>No\r\nsignificant abnormality is seen in USG scanning of upper abdomen.<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<\/div>","page":{"size":"595.45pt 841.7pt","margin":"151.2pt 36.0pt 72.0pt 36.0pt"}}